3</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/salchak-toka"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/salchak-toka.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Salchak Toka</span><span class="tp">1901–1973</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/e-e-evans-pritchard"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">E. E. Evans-Pritchard</span><span class="tp">1902–1973</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/francesco-jacomoni"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Francesco Jacomoni</span><span class="tp">1893–1973</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/harold-ingrams"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Harold Ingrams</span><span class="tp">1897–1973</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
